1
00:00:20,112 --> 00:00:32,535
Oh my darling, you took all that I am

2
00:00:33,848 --> 00:00:38,391
The world outside is so inconceivable

3
00:00:38,472 --> 00:00:41,854
You took me where I stand

4
00:00:42,925 --> 00:00:48,439
Oh the morning, see the clouds,

5
00:00:48,819 --> 00:00:51,662
They come in tow

6
00:00:52,282 --> 00:00:57,390
The tide painted a tired seascape

7
00:00:58,603 --> 00:01:02,602
Waiting for the blow

8
00:01:03,775 --> 00:01:09,891
But I was never alone

9
00:01:09,891 --> 00:01:10,707
I was never low

10
00:01:10,811 --> 00:01:13,852
And so the feeling grows

11
00:01:14,212 --> 00:01:16,073
The feeling grows

12
00:01:17,501 --> 00:01:21,491
See the tide

13
00:01:22,986 --> 00:01:32,329
See it shift to and fro

14
00:01:33,956 --> 00:01:37,298
I’m all strung out searching

15
00:01:37,358 --> 00:01:41,980
For answers that I will never know

16
00:01:43,061 --> 00:01:55,448
So why were you a forest fire

17
00:01:56,054 --> 00:02:05,351
Burning all that I had ever desired?

18
00:02:06,328 --> 00:02:13,839
And why were you so quiet?

19
00:02:15,134 --> 00:02:18,436
It was only in your silence

20
00:02:18,816 --> 00:02:23,158
That I saw bone

21
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:27,741
But I was never alone

22
00:02:27,841 --> 00:02:31,563
I was never low

23
00:02:33,884 --> 00:02:45,749
And so the feeling grows

24
00:02:50,952 --> 00:03:01,596
The feeling grows

25
00:03:06,798 --> 00:03:33,290
You burnt me to the ground

26
00:03:38,493 --> 00:03:46,121
I see that now

27
00:03:48,743 --> 00:03:55,490
Looking back I see just how

28
00:03:57,152 --> 00:04:03,990
Pain has made me better
